# Title

StageWorker Base and Per-Phase Agent Workers

# Scope

Build `ngv2/workers/base.py` and the per-phase workers under `ngv2/workers/` (`hunt.py`, `triage.py`, `verify.py`, `poc.py`, `detonate.py`, `novelty.py`, `report.py`). `base.py` implements the StageWorker runner to fetch tasks, execute stage functions, and write structured artifacts. Each phase worker implements `run_stage` by composing the injected llm-client seam with relevant phase modules and returning artifact dictionaries.

# Non-Goals

Must not edit existing modules. Must not call external services, live models, network endpoints, or shell subprocesses. A heavy cross-module integration test is out of scope.

# Inputs

Consumes `ngv2/llm_client.py` (injected model seam), `ngv2/poc_writer.py`, `ngv2/poc_repair_loop.py`, `ngv2/detonation.py`, `ngv2/novelty_gate.py`, `ngv2/submission_package.py`, and dataclasses from `ngv2/contracts.py`.

# Deliverables

Produces `ngv2/workers/base.py` which exposes `StageWorker` class. Produces per-phase worker files under `ngv2/workers/` each of which exposes `run_stage(context: dict, seams: dict) -> list[dict]`.
